  "description": "The SUPREME DH V5 RIDE is as comfortable between the tape or against the clock as it is on any bike park track.\n• The ROCKSHOX BoXXer fork is easy to adjust and is adaptable to all riders thanks to its air spring. Reliable and offering consistent performance, it is coupled with the high-performance Charger cartridge. The ROCKSHOX Super Deluxe Select R shock brings sensitivity and dynamism. The volume of both the negative and positive chambers can be adjusted independently.\n• Braking is managed with a pair of TRP DH-R EVO brakes. They are powerful, durable, progressive and precise.\n• SPANK 359 wheels are perfect for riders looking for strong, reliable, and comfortable wheels.\n• Transmission is provided by SRAM with the GX DH group. 7-speed shifting is precise and ideal for downhill riding.",
